msgstr "Az ennél nagyobb csatolmányok átalakítása (MB)"

#: d4/app/Admin/Pages/Page_Epanel_Settings.php:518
#: d5/dashboard/build/bundle.js:2
msgid ""
"Choose the attachment size limit at which files are converted to secure "
